    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc821e376cf97a9a3172316d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "太阳神！！！！！！\n我收下你的干劲了──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d877000b1ec3feee4e6465b39959df8c9300a628df2d7b687242ffef6bda22d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064325.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b332092cc2406b54314b92f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白善信在最后，\n施展出了无人能及的全力跳跃──",
      "source_fingerprint": "22f4c50cb9127aad5a5219a844ca4a09c01bd641715db5015e958cd6d3871253",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064325.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        60,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/60/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f164104c240f8e39c2d0352",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以比任何一场比赛都要快的速度，\n逃离了现场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6aa9f92b6687a94d1cf96200e3b9f6485f3d4808bd3a127476fc5cb6f2436aff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064325.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        61,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/61/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ae0a14d22d1656f91aefd3d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白善信",
      "source_fingerprint": "292838dd30209de26be736979e1f3a3bc826881c9ce11ed7480a487776eff441",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064325.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ed0467ed3ba426c8ccf7171",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "剩下的交给我！！！！\n我们是……永远的好麻吉──！！！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "001fc257fd79dc70ffe5680dff1aab5031e1b8b4f17737cbbb4641abac579ab9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064325.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e293de86ce693132294a6801",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白善信在宣告友情不灭的同时，\n留下了名留青史的疯狂奔跑。然后──",
      "source_fingerprint": "99c2e91273d82c8e62ade4e4d03a10e373ba28b628dc101752f055f03a3d36f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064325.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c992680d37cb2935ecfca553",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "实况",
      "source_fingerprint": "50349a592c466fb97eeafeb81fd3fa65c8c3b2e779463937300c4c8f97230140",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064325.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ce06a241c86b20f4937204a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白善信超越了\n放慢速度的大拓太阳神！\n然后现在，她率先抵达终点──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c70619e968fb1cbdcb317a8f4e93f183292f3b472a8a0ea3387966b4591de3f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064325.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba7ab85e546d355223f5b3c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・友情接棒☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "eedd9654c6bd2d74fc9342d747124b57dad74a5433b30b3d1d8bbd9d94663684",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064325.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:269d66c925d35942a5e62e77",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白善信生于名门目白家。\n她想逃离目白这个头衔，活得像自己，\n但她认为这是件很困难的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2ab494f81117b1cae5ad6994baa972873efcbabb974f7dde534fb77ff10f696",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9641262670e55c0f93502429",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在某一天，她参加了花式自由赛。\n她在爆速领头后接受喝采，尝到自由奔跑的喜悦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f9a6027b6d2cacac63adfe7fd40a23496ecd794b06f37768711c6793563918e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28b6e7a783bdf1dd4643588b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后，她与同样擅长爆速领头的\n大拓太阳神成为好麻吉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e5b5878b2547a1f5bae19406058b4f059481f3103961553e3ed44dca7acab67",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4fffc32d43c88bae5a071f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白善信摆脱束缚，\n决定以辣妹身份奔跑。\n作为目白家的派对玩咖，她要以顶点为目标！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed99bc89a2cfce7b26cb0e0821a880f2de43a94724946c71f63c2d5ee07741d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54007edf04f59850b7d942f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白善信登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6c2c4ba349466fa3bc3ddbc7e09615d87f9b11af62a1b6f92f38af0b31e9544",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a67e06f32f7d59dfe64318e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白善信为了彻底成为派对玩咖，\n与大拓太阳神一同外出。在街上狂欢后，\n理解到快不快乐是看自己的心情决定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b726c7b320eba9ff3e716f588d7eac7293fa39ba32c1ed4604d20ec1e1daa87e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a068bb63b5f1710154557a0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白善信夸张的行为也传到了目白家。\n但目白家的奶奶什么都不说，\n决定静静旁观。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fceccdbba07d6ee1b17e248decc85a878cce3e2b6234f82dc4171cde238dc1c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e698ecdd10fe201b54e594b7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来过派对玩咖生活吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "52c9b1e132a1aa48edb5c547faf103053cbcd3419b0c78d2e8dcb939f8248e54",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e5209b83d7d78d6a27a7018",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白善信烦恼着，\n要不要以经典级赛马娘最大的舞台\n“经典三冠”为目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c358b0c68b7e12ba042409610d9664ed24e7d545bff3e2e7f6fdca2cfc0b9b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b59c7b2ebe92579950929eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她不想大败而归被人嘲笑，\n但因为向往那些比赛，也不想不参加。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d99257a08fe3204864fdc12edb9d700c545d27a9a023e040168d27aac06892db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:facae7bc5566d0fa4fd0a0bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在不断烦恼后，关于经典三冠\n采取“如果想跑就去跑”的方针，\n把接近比赛时，她自己的出赛意愿放第一位。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7b836accde7c224f890adb9b1a73feaef04bb8b5e3f44d07002209d30460a69",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
