      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大拓太阳神\n为了在目白善信身边鼓励她，\n决定跑“宝冢纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3866aa2fe69bb00dfc6018085d69c67b9ac5b15efa94c0e48cb1fea9ba5323c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
