      "uid": "zhcn:9a74d665ecd481cc357c9915",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大拓太阳神因为过劳而倒下。\n对本为英里跑者她而言，\n中距离用的训练负荷太重了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7038e9ea6794d97dbfaa49ed12fc03870ca0e6e504d0c4ff58887fd9573b1c54",
