      "uid": "zhcn:7207f6bde2159587e8f0de9e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或许她真正想做的，\n是“跑步”以外的事。\n她决定探索自己最根本的想法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2de350e6d9f3b78bf7cd8f3602a6befd4a73562aace95fe5f378dcd95b486206",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
