      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为准备秋季的竞赛，她们开始集训，\n“天皇赏（秋）”将会强者云集一事\n也传了开来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "334f53a81beea5026cbef1afc72183c1c5a7aa52ade42cb80edd9be8935f2429",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
